# schtest.budget -- The budgets of the cases of test/schtest.sh
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# rss KB cpu S -- CASE: the peak resident set of a case and the time it
# took on the processor, user and system, as build/budget
# (test/budget.c) measured them the first time.  A case may take a
# tenth more memory and a quarter more time, and 0.02 s besides:
# more fails it.
margin rss 1.1 cpu 1.25 slack 0.02
